    Bug 1963315 - Populate prefs based on presence of extensions and experiments.r=freaktechnik


    The IAN system needs to know if users have installed extensions or
    Experiments, in order to make suggestions to move to the Release
    channel. This patch adds a task to the idle-after-startup section, which
    populates two status prefs according to the current environment, and
    also adds listeners in order to update the prefs if the user adds or
    removes add-ons.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D248409

